    "The service, its games and everything on it are provided \"as is\" and \"as available\", without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including any warranty of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose or non-infringement. We don't promise it will always be available, free of mistakes or safe for every person to play, or that your account, runs and places will be kept. You use it at your own risk.",
    "Some games have flashing lights and fast motion. Read the Health warning before you play.",
    "# Limits on our liability",
    "As far as the law allows, [operator] is not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages, or for any loss of data, accounts, runs or places, arising from your use of the service or the games, even if told such loss was possible. As far as the law allows, our total liability for any claim about the service is limited to zero, since you paid nothing for it. Some places don't allow these limits, and there they apply only as far as the law of that place allows. [To be reviewed by a lawyer for each place we serve.]",
